claim_principal: claude
author: claude
acceptance_criteria: "The shebang claim is reproduced in the suite, including the two negative cases; The corpus reads the same seven cases as every other converged repository"
close_reason: "Docstring corrected and reproduced (4 states, including both negatives). pm-ops ^2026.9.7 installed. Corpus now reads the same seven cases as every other converged repository, all of them open in the canonical implementation and all closed by unbraind/pm-ops#100. Gates: typecheck pass, docstring 71/71, coverage thresholds met, 7 tests pass / 0 fail."
body: ""
